摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A chord between code and natural language — CHORDS = Code Harness, Online Reference for DeepSeek.","id":"gh:1336542324","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-chords","slug":"GinerYard/dsh-chords","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-bundle","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A chord between code and natural language — CHORDS = Code Harness, Online Reference for DeepSeek."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-chords · Chords（和弦）"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> DeepSeek Harness 插件：代码与自然语言的**和弦**；CHORDS = Code Harness, Online Reference for DeepSeek.\n>\n> A Dee"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"pSeek Harness plugin: a chord between code and natural language — CHORDS = Code Harness, Online Refe"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"n: a chord between code and natural language — CHORDS = Code Harness, Online Reference for DeepSeek."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"版本 Version: **0.3.3** | 兼容 Compatible with: **DeepSeek Harness 0.1.0-rc.6**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 功能特性 / Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **双栏卡片**：左侧代码（语法高亮 + 行号），右侧分块伪代码（通俗易懂的自然语言）\n**Dual-pane card**: code on the left (syntax highlight"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" + line numbers), chunked pseudocode on the right (real natural language, never if/for/new keywords)"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"\n- **三色确定性标签**：🔵 明确（用户要求）/ 🟡 推测（上下文推导）/ ⚪ 默认（惯例填充）\n**Certainty labels**: 🔵 Explicit / 🟡 Inferred / ⚪"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" Default\n- **锚点高亮**：悬停解释块 → 对应代码行整行琥珀色高亮；点击任一侧 → 对侧滚动居中\n**Anchor highlighting**: hover a pseudocode "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"block to light the exact code lines; click either side to center the counterpart\n- **原地编辑**：✎ 修改（块级精"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"修）/ ✎ 改算法（整体重设计）；后台 LLM 完成，**对话完全零污染**\n**In-place editing**: block-level edits and whole-card redesi"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"gns run in the background — the conversation stays untouched\n- **版本历史**：◀ ▶ 浏览任意历史版本；基于任意版本修改都追加为最新版"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"本；每卡上限 20 版\n**Version history**: browse any past version with ◀ ▶; edits based on any version always"},{"id":"p6s9","text":" append as the newest; 20 versions per card\n- **重命名**：点击标题即可改名；改名链保证旧标题查询依然命中、刷新后依然生效\n**Rename**: cl"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"ick the title to rename; the rename chain keeps old titles resolvable across refreshes\n- **Agent 集成*"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"*：后台修改自动进入运行时上下文；chords_current / chords_list / chords_history 供 agent 查询任意版本\n**Agent integration**:"},{"id":"p6s12","text":" background edits surface in the runtime context; three query tools let the agent read any version\n-"},{"id":"p6s13","text":" **持久化**：文档、历史、改名链落盘，重启存活；TTL 自动老化；会话销毁即清理\n**Persistence**: docs, history and rename chains survive "},{"id":"p6s14","text":"restarts; TTL aging; cleaned up on session disposal\n- **自动国际化**：非中文系统自动切换英文界面\n**Auto i18n**: English"},{"id":"p6s15","text":" UI on non-Chinese systems\n- **分层模型路由**：按代码长度自动选择模型档位与思考级别（见下文）\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 环境要求 / Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness 已安装（dsh 命令可用，web profile 可启动），版本 0.1.0-rc.6 或 API 兼容\nDeepSeek Harness installed ("},{"id":"p8s2","text":"the dsh command works and the web profile boots), version 0.1.0-rc.6 or API-compatible\n- 模型路由可用（默认 d"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"eepseek-official；其他厂商需对应适配器已安装）\nA usable model route (deepseek-official by default; other vendors ne"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ed their adapters installed)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 安装 / Installation"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 1. 复制插件目录 / Copy the plugin directory"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 2. 注册插件 / Register the plugin"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"编辑 `$env:DSH_HOME\\profiles\\web\\cordis.patch.yml`，把 `[]` 替换为："},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 3. 重启 / Restart"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"刷新浏览器页面。让 agent 生成一段代码，应出现双栏卡片。\nRefresh the browser. Ask the agent to write some code — the dual-pan"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e card should appear."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 使用教程 / Tutorial"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 1. 生成卡片 / Create a card"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"在对话里让 agent 写代码。agent 会自动调用 chords，\n代码以双栏卡片呈现，且不会在正文重复粘贴。\nAsk the agent for code in the conversation"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" (e.g. write a merge sort in Python). The agent calls\nchords automatically: the code appears as a du"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"al-pane card and is never duplicated in the message."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 2. 阅读卡片 / Reading the card"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- 左侧代码：语法高亮、行号、整行可点\nLeft pane: highlighted code with line numbers; each full line is clickable\n- 右侧每"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"个解释块：块 id、行号徽章（如 L3-7）、确定性圆点、伪代码、复杂度徽章、理由\nRight pane blocks: id, line-range chip (e.g. L3-7), certai"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"nty dot, pseudocode, complexity chips, rationale\n- 悬停解释块 → 对应代码行整行高亮；点击任一侧 → 对侧滚动居中\nHover a block to"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" light the matching code lines; click either side to center the counterpart"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### 3. 修改卡片/ Edit a card"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- 块级精修：悬停解释块 → 点「✎ 修改」→ 改写该块伪代码 → 「提交修改」。只改这一块，其余保持不变\nBlock edit: hover a block → ✎ Edit → rewrite i"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ts pseudocode → Submit. Only that block changes\n- 整体重设计：点「✎ 改算法」→ 用自然语言描述新算法 → 「提交重设计」。允许自由重新分块\nWhol"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"e redesign: ✎ Redesign → describe the new algorithm in natural language → Submit redesign. Re-chunki"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ng is allowed\n- 修改在后台由 LLM 完成，卡片原地更新（版本 +1、摘要提示），对话里不会出现任何消息\nThe edit runs in the background; the ca"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"rd updates in place (version +1, summary toast). No conversation messages appear\n- 进行中可「终止修改」；同一时间一张"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"卡只允许一个在途修改\nYou can Stop an in-flight edit; one edit at a time per card"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 4. 版本历史 / Version history"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- 卡片头部 ◀ v2/5 ▶ 浏览历史版本；「回到最新」返回\nUse ◀ v2/5 ▶ in the header to browse past versions; Back to latest r"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"eturns\n- 从任意历史版本发起修改，结果都追加为最新版本（不分支、不覆盖历史）\nEdits started from any past version always append as the "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"newest version (no branching, history is never rewritten)\n- 刷新/重启后历史依然完整（宿主持久化）\nHistory survives ref"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"reshes and restarts (host-persisted)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 数据与隐私 / Data and privacy"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- 插件数据（文档、版本历史、改名链、修改摘要）只落在本机：`<DSH_HOME>/storages/code_lens.json`\nAll plugin data (docs, version hi"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"story, rename chains, edit summaries) stays local: <DSH_HOME>/storages/code_lens.json\n- 无更新超过 ttlDay"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"s（默认 14 天）自动过期；会话销毁即清理该会话全部数据\nDocuments idle for ttlDays (default 14) expire; disposing a session wi"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"pes its data\n- 代码内容本身不离开你配置的模型路由（与普通对话一致）\nCode content never leaves your configured model route (sam"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"e as ordinary conversations)"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
